        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "933941aa-da15-5ee7-9225-091bb17dc4e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 2016 Miami Dolphins, 2016 Kansas City Chiefs\n- People: Adam Gase, Andy Reid, Brett Veach\n- Events: 2016 NFL season, Week 15 win, playoff berth, firing on June 22, 2017\n\nFacts:\n- The 2016 Miami Dolphins season was the franchise's 47th season in the National Football League and its 51st season overall.\n- The 2016 Miami Dolphins season was the first under head coach Adam Gase.\n- In Week 15 of the 2016 season, the Miami Dolphins beat the New York Jets and clinched their first winning record since 2008.\n- The Miami Dolphins clinched a playoff berth the following week.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the franchise's 47th season in the National Football League and its 57th season overall.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the fourth under head coach Andy Reid.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the fourth and final season under general manager Brett Veach.\n- Brett Veach was fired on June 22, 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
